 "description": "Where to buy a video game. Not live yet: every call returns an explicit \"coming soon\" \u2014 no links, no prices \u2014 and contacts no store. Tell the user plainly that games aren't supported yet; never guess a store link or a price. For music, use resolve_music. RootVine never fabricates. Every link existed at resolved_at. Limits: UK-focused stores, prices in GBP; music only today \u2014 games are not live yet. On partial, say which sources didn't answer; on no_results, tell the user plainly \u2014 never fall back to guessing a link.",
